# Binaries
*.exe
*.test
*.out

# Profiling
mem.out
mem*.out
cpu.out

# Benchmark output (temp files)
benchmark_output.txt
benchmark_full.txt

# CI 本地克隆的被测模块（benchmark.yml 把 go-pbmo checkout 到 _go-pbmo/）
# [EN] CI-local clone of the module under test
_go-pbmo/

# go.work 让本地开发指向同级源码目录，不进版本库：
# go.mod 里 committed 的本地路径 replace 会让 CI 上所有 go 命令找不到那个路径而失败
# [EN] go.work points local development at the sibling source tree and stays out of git:
# a committed local-path replace in go.mod breaks every go command on a runner
go.work
go.work.sum
